{title: 069 - Lord, Make Us More Holy}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #069 • LORD MAKE US MORE HOLY • 6.6.6.6}
{lyricist: American Negro Spiritual}
{composer: Alma Blackmon}
{key: Eb}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 69}
{meta: tune LORD MAKE US MORE HOLY}
{meta: meter 6.6.6.6}
{meta: category Worship - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Eb]Lord, make us more holy;
[Ab]Lord, make us more [Eb]holy;
[Eb]Lord, make us [Ab]more holy
[Eb/Bb]Until [Bb7]we meet again.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[Eb]Lord, make us more faithful;
[Ab]Lord, make us more [Eb]faithful;
[Eb]Lord, make us [Ab]more faithful
[Eb/Bb]Until [Bb7]we meet again.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[Eb]Lord, make us more humble;
[Ab]Lord, make us more [Eb]humble;
[Eb]Lord, make us [Ab]more humble
[Eb/Bb]Until [Bb7]we meet again.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 4}
[Eb]Lord, make us more loving;
[Ab]Lord, make us more [Eb]loving;
[Ab]Lord, make us more [Eb]loving
[Eb]Until we [Ab]meet again.
[Eb]Like Jesus, [Ab]the Savior,
[Eb/Bb]Until [Bb7]we meet again.
{end_of_verse}
